[ti:Shakti jaag ri]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Shakti jaag ri…
[00:13.75]Shakti jaag ri…
[00:19.51]Antar jyoti prajwalit ho ri…
[00:25.26]Man soya tan khoya,
[00:31.02]Shwaason mein uljha jag saara,
[00:36.77]Naam tera jab goonje bheetar,
[00:42.53]Jaage chetan deep hamaara…
[00:48.28]Jaag re maanav pehchaan tu,
[00:54.04]Kan-kan mein brahm samaaya,
[00:59.79]Tu hi prashna tu hi uttar,
[01:05.55]Tu hi jyoti tu hi chaaya…
[01:11.30]Lam… Lam… prithvi ka kampan…
[01:17.06]Vam… Vam… ras ki dhaara…
[01:22.81]Ram… Ram… agni prajwalit…
[01:28.57]Yam… Yam… hriday vistaar…
[01:34.32]Ham… Ham… shabd shuddh ho…
[01:40.08]Om… Om… bindu prakaa▮▮▮…
[01:45.83]Shakti jaag ri!
[01:51.59]Maanav jaag ri!
[01:57.34]Antar brahm pehchaan ri!
[02:03.10]Agyan ka tam tootey aaj,
[02:08.85]Gyaan ki jwaala prakat ho aaj,
[02:14.61]Tu hi srishti tu hi karta,
[02:20.36]Tu hi ant aur tu hi aarambh aaj!
[02:26.12]Shakti jaag ri… jaag ri… jaag ri…
[02:31.87]Antar shoonya mein poorn samaaya…
[02:37.63]Shwaas mein shaanti, naad mein shoonya,
[02:43.38]Man hua ab nirmal poorn,
[02:49.14]Shakti jaag ri…
[02:54.89]Shakti sthir ho ri…
[03:00.65]Chetna poorn ho ri…
